Aisha Khan: FYI I opened a small docs PR to fix the POST /v1/generate API reference. The response_format enum in the current page is out of date (only shows ["json", "text"]). The runtime accepts ["text", "json", "sse"]; default is "text". PR: <https://github.com/redwood-inference/redwood-docs/pull/4680|#4680>. Please review examples.
Diego Rivera: Thanks Aisha. Can you paste the corrected minimal schema so I can sign off quickly?
Aisha Khan: Pasted in the PR and copying here for visibility:
```json
{
  "request": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "input": {"type": "string"},
      "response_format": {"type": "string", "enum": ["text", "json", "sse"], "default": "text"},
      "max_tokens": {"type": "integer"}
    },
    "required": ["input"]
  },
  "response": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "id": {"type": "string"},
      "outputs": {"type": "array"}
    }
  }
}
```
Priya Nair: Noticed the cURL example has max_tokens quoted. That should be a number. I'll push a quick commit to fix that and a tiny wording tweak around streaming.
Aisha Khan: Great, thanks. Also adding an SSE cURL example and a short note that requesting response_format: "sse" will return server-sent events (equivalent to stream=true for this endpoint).
Evan Li: Can someone update the SDK snippets too? The Python example in the page still looks like raw JSON POST. Suggest replacing with the Client usage so it's idiomatic. Proposed Python snippet:
```python
from redwood import Client
client = Client()
resp = client.generate(input="Explain Newton's third law.", response_format="json", max_tokens=120)
print(resp.outputs[0].text)
```
Priya Nair: I'll also update the Node examples to use camelCase and add a short note in the migration guide (docs/migration/v1_to_v2.md) mentioning the expanded enum so integrators are aware.
docs-bot: docs-site build passed for commit 9f8b7a (:white_check_mark:)
Diego Rivera: Looks good to me after the quoted-number fix. @Priya please re-run checks and approve when ready.
Priya Nair: Done, pushed the cURL fix and adjusted the examples. Approving now.
Aisha Khan: Thanks all 44d I'll merge after CI completes. Ping here if any other param typos show up.
